   "description": "Book a place to stay, order from local kitchens, get tickets to what's on near you and pay for all of it from your payAll wallet. One app for the things you do every week, made in South Africa.\n\nSTAYS\nFind cottages, homes, guesthouses and apartments across South Africa.\n• Every photo, the house rules, amenities and guest reviews before you book\n• Meet your host on their profile and chat before and during your stay\n• See which dates are free and the full price, with cleaning and service fees, before you pay\n• Book and pay in the app, then rate your stay to help the next guest\n\nFOOD\nKotas, braai, pizza, sushi, curry and more from kitchens near you.\n• Search by dish or store and filter by what you feel like\n• Add notes for the kitchen and your driver\n• Follow your order from the kitchen to your door\n• Rate your meal and your delivery\n\nEVENTS\nConcerts, sport, comedy and markets near you.\n• Get tickets in a few taps; your ticket is a QR code on your phone, with nothing to print\n• Show the QR code at the gate and you're in\n• Watch live streams from events and join the chat\n• Subscribe to an event and hear when someone goes live\n\nPAY\nYour payAll wallet is built in.\n• Top up and pay for stays, food and tickets from your balance\n• Send money to friends and family on payAll\n• Scan a seller's payAll QR code to pay in person\n• Every payment and refund in one place\n\nHOST, SELL OR ORGANISE\npayAll is for the people behind the places, kitchens and events too.\n• Hosts: list a room, cottage or whole house, manage bookings and your calendar, and sync it with other booking sites so the same night is never booked twice\n• Food sellers: open a store, add your menu, take orders, and serve walk-in customers witle\n• Drivers: deliver orders and earn per delivery\n• Organisers: create events, sell tickets, check guests in at the gate with your phone, a\n• Earnings are paid into your payAll wallet, and you can withdraw to any South African bank account\n\nSAFE AND FAIR\n• Hosts, sellers and organisers are verified before they can take money\n• Ratings and reviews come only from real stays, orders and tickets\n• Report anything that doesn't look right, and payAll's team reviews it",
